      { question: "How do I know if my laptop requires proprietary charging instead of standard USB-PD?", answer: "Search for the exact model and 'USB-C charging' or 'USB Power Delivery.' If the spec sheet lists only the barrel-plug adapter wattage and does not explicitly mention USB-PD support, the laptop may refuse full-speed charging over USB-C without a proprietary dock." }
